{"seq":4,"slug":"teleport-and-suspense","title":"Teleport 与 Suspense","url":"/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/teleport-and-suspense","wordCount":473,"readingTime":2,"markdown":"# Teleport 与 Suspense\n\n## 打破组件树限制\n\nVue 3 引入了两个内置组件来解决组件渲染位置和异步加载的问题：`<Teleport>` 将内容渲染到 DOM 树的任意位置，`<Suspense>` 协调异步组件的加载流程。\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph ComponentTree[\"组件树\"]\n        App --> Page --> Modal[\"Modal 组件\"]\n    end\n    subgraph DOMTree[\"DOM 树\"]\n        Body[\"body\"]\n        Body --> AppDiv[\"#app\"]\n        Body --> ModalDiv[\"#modal-root\"]\n    end\n    Modal --> |Teleport| ModalDiv\n```\n\n## 核心概念\n\n- **Teleport**：把内容渲染到组件树之外的 DOM 位置，同时保留组件树中的逻辑父子关系与事件冒泡。\n- **传送目标**：`to` 接受 CSS 选择器或 DOM 元素，`disabled` 可条件性关闭传送回到原位渲染。\n- **逻辑位置 vs 物理位置**：Teleport 让二者分离——组件数据仍来自声明处，DOM 却落在别处。\n- **Suspense**：等待异步依赖（顶层 `await`）就绪期间先展示 `#fallback`，就绪后切换到 `#default`。\n- **嵌套 Suspense**：不同区域可各自管理加载状态，互不阻塞。\n\n---\n\n## Teleport 基础\n\n`<Teleport>` 将其内部内容\"传送\"到目标 DOM 元素中，同时保留组件树中的逻辑父子关系：\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref } from 'vue';\n\nconst showModal = ref<boolean>(false);\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <button @click=\"showModal = true\">打开弹窗</button>\n\n  <Teleport to=\"body\">\n    <div v-if=\"showModal\" class=\"modal-overlay\" @click.self=\"showModal = false\">\n      <div class=\"modal-content\">\n        <h2>弹窗标题</h2>\n        <p>弹窗内容会被渲染到 body 下，但仍然可以访问父组件的数据。</p>\n        <p>showModal: {{ showModal }}</p>\n        <button @click=\"showModal = false\">关闭</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </Teleport>\n</template>\n```\n\n### Teleport 属性\n\n| 属性       | 类型                    | 说明                              |\n| ---------- | ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `to`       | `string \\| HTMLElement` | 目标容器（CSS 选择器或 DOM 元素） |\n| `disabled` | `boolean`               | 禁用传送，内容在原位渲染          |\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref } from 'vue';\n\nconst isMobile = ref<boolean>(window.innerWidth < 768);\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <!-- 移动端在原位渲染，桌面端传送到 body -->\n  <Teleport to=\"body\" :disabled=\"isMobile\">\n    <div class=\"sidebar\">侧边栏内容</div>\n  </Teleport>\n</template>\n```\n\n### 多个 Teleport 到同一目标\n\n多个 `<Teleport>` 可以传送到同一目标，按顺序追加：\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <Teleport to=\"#notifications\">\n    <div class=\"toast\">通知 1</div>\n  </Teleport>\n  <Teleport to=\"#notifications\">\n    <div class=\"toast\">通知 2</div>\n  </Teleport>\n</template>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Teleport 实战场景\n\n### 全局通知系统\n\n```vue\n<!-- NotificationProvider.vue -->\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { provide, ref, type InjectionKey } from 'vue';\n\ninterface Notification {\n  id: number;\n  message: string;\n  type: 'success' | 'error' | 'info';\n}\n\ninterface NotificationContext {\n  notifications: typeof notifications;\n  add: (msg: string, type?: Notification['type']) => void;\n  remove: (id: number) => void;\n}\n\nexport const NotificationKey: InjectionKey<NotificationContext> = Symbol();\n\nconst notifications = ref<Notification[]>([]);\nlet nextId = 0;\n\nfunction add(message: string, type: Notification['type'] = 'info') {\n  const id = nextId++;\n  notifications.value.push({ id, message, type });\n  setTimeout(() => remove(id), 3000);\n}\n\nfunction remove(id: number) {\n  notifications.value = notifications.value.filter((n) => n.id !== id);\n}\n\nprovide(NotificationKey, { notifications, add, remove });\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <slot />\n  <Teleport to=\"body\">\n    <div class=\"notification-container\">\n      <TransitionGroup name=\"notification\">\n        <div v-for=\"n in notifications\" :key=\"n.id\" :class=\"['notification', `notification--${n.type}`]\">\n          {{ n.message }}\n        </div>\n      </TransitionGroup>\n    </div>\n  </Teleport>\n</template>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Suspense 深入\n\n### 异步 setup\n\n使用顶层 `await` 的组件会被视为异步组件，必须由 `<Suspense>` 包裹：\n\n```vue\n<!-- AsyncProfile.vue -->\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ninterface UserProfile {\n  name: string;\n  avatar: string;\n  bio: string;\n}\n\nconst res = await fetch('/api/profile');\nconst profile: UserProfile = await res.json();\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"profile\">\n    <img :src=\"profile.avatar\" :alt=\"profile.name\" />\n    <h2>{{ profile.name }}</h2>\n    <p>{{ profile.bio }}</p>\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### fallback 内容\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <Suspense>\n    <AsyncProfile />\n    <template #fallback>\n      <div class=\"skeleton\">\n        <div class=\"skeleton-avatar\" />\n        <div class=\"skeleton-text\" />\n        <div class=\"skeleton-text short\" />\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </Suspense>\n</template>\n```\n\n### 嵌套 Suspense\n\n```vue\n<template>\n  <Suspense>\n    <template #default>\n      <AsyncLayout>\n        <!-- 内层 Suspense 独立管理自己的异步状态 -->\n        <Suspense>\n          <AsyncContent />\n          <template #fallback>\n            <p>内容加载中...</p>\n          </template>\n        </Suspense>\n      </AsyncLayout>\n    </template>\n    <template #fallback>\n      <p>布局加载中...</p>\n    </template>\n  </Suspense>\n</template>\n```\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    S1[\"外层 Suspense\"]\n    S1 --> |就绪| Layout[\"AsyncLayout\"]\n    S1 --> |未就绪| F1[\"布局加载中...\"]\n    Layout --> S2[\"内层 Suspense\"]\n    S2 --> |就绪| Content[\"AsyncContent\"]\n    S2 --> |未就绪| F2[\"内容加载中...\"]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 错误处理\n\n`<Suspense>` 本身不处理错误，需要配合 `onErrorCaptured` 或 `<ErrorBoundary>`：\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref, onErrorCaptured } from 'vue';\n\nconst error = ref<Error | null>(null);\n\nonErrorCaptured((err) => {\n  error.value = err as Error;\n  return false;\n});\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div v-if=\"error\" class=\"error-state\">\n    <p>加载失败：{{ error.message }}</p>\n    <button @click=\"error = null\">重试</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <Suspense v-else>\n    <AsyncPage />\n    <template #fallback>\n      <LoadingSkeleton />\n    </template>\n  </Suspense>\n</template>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 小结\n\n- `<Teleport>` 将内容渲染到 DOM 的任意位置，适用于弹窗、通知、全局浮层等场景\n- `to` 属性接受 CSS 选择器或 DOM 元素，`disabled` 可条件性禁用传送\n- 多个 `<Teleport>` 可传送到同一目标，按声明顺序追加\n- `<Suspense>` 协调异步组件（顶层 `await`）的加载状态，通过 `#fallback` 显示加载 UI\n- 嵌套 `<Suspense>` 允许不同区域独立管理各自的异步加载状态\n- 错误处理需配合 `onErrorCaptured` 实现，`<Suspense>` 本身不捕获错误\n","prev":{"title":"动态组件","url":"/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/dynamic-components"},"next":{"title":"Pinia 基础","url":"/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/state-management/pinia-fundamentals"}}